Adapt Chromium to the common BoringSSL API.

BoringSSL 558e6eef5d7c9fc3cd1d8d464efb052ad50bbc21 folds signature
algorithm GREASE into the general GREASE control. The public DER OCSP
overload uses the previous default verification policy (1024-bit minimum
RSA and SHA-1 allowed); retain the caller's time and age constraints.

